{"id":1189,"date":"2026-08-20T22:45:55","date_gmt":"2026-08-20T22:45:55","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/?post_type=knowledgebase&#038;p=1189"},"modified":"2026-08-21T12:03:48","modified_gmt":"2026-08-21T12:03:48","slug":"emojis","status":"publish","type":"knowledgebase","link":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/db\/emojis\/emojis\/","title":{"rendered":"Emojis"},"content":{"rendered":"<div style=\"color: #2b2b2b;\">\n<h2 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Emojis<\/span><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1193\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Emojis.webp\" alt=\"Inserting an Emoji\" width=\"365\" height=\"420\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Emojis.webp 868w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Emojis-260x300.webp 260w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Emojis-768x885.webp 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 365px) 100vw, 365px\" \/><\/h2>\n<p class=\"western\">The Emojis gallery (formerly labelled \u201cClassic Clipart\u201d) provides access to the full <strong>Twemoji<\/strong> library &#8211; Twitter&#8217;s open-source, high-quality emoji set rendered as scalable SVG graphics. Because they are SVGs rather than raster images, emojis remain perfectly crisp at any size on screen, in PDFs, and in print.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Inserting an Emoji<\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">To insert an emoji:<\/p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Go to <strong>Insert &gt; Emojis<\/strong>.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">The Emoji modal opens, displaying the full Twemoji library.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Browse or use the search bar to find an emoji, then <strong>double-click<\/strong> it to insert it. Alternatively, click once to select it and then click <strong>OK<\/strong>.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Scalable &amp; Stretchable Emojis<\/span><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1196\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/AspectRatioEmojis.webp\" alt=\"Scalable &amp; Stretchable Emojis\" width=\"208\" height=\"181\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/AspectRatioEmojis.webp 530w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/AspectRatioEmojis-300x262.webp 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 208px) 100vw, 208px\" \/><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">Emojis in Open Publisher are inserted as <strong>inline SVGs<\/strong> rather than linked image files, with <span style=\"font-family: Courier New, monospace;\">preserveAspectRatio=&#8221;none&#8221;<\/span> applied. This means they stretch freely to fill any bounding box &#8211; useful for creating oversized decorative emoji elements &#8211; without leaving white letterbox space around the sides. This resolves a limitation present in the older <span style=\"font-family: Courier New, monospace;\">&lt;img&gt;<\/span> implementation.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Automatic Upgrade of Older Documents<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1202\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/svg.webp\" alt=\"Automatic Upgrade of Older Documents\" width=\"144\" height=\"151\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/svg.webp 425w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/svg-287x300.webp 287w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 144px) 100vw, 144px\" \/><\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">When you open a document that contains older emoji <span style=\"font-family: Courier New, monospace;\">&lt;img&gt;<\/span> elements, Open Publisher automatically upgrades them to the new inline SVG format in the background. No manual action is required &#8211; your existing documents are silently updated to benefit from the improved scalability and rendering.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Emojis The Emojis gallery (formerly labelled \u201cClassic Clipart\u201d) provides access to the full Twemoji library &#8211; Twitter&#8217;s open-source, high-quality emoji set rendered as scalable SVG graphics. Because they are SVGs rather than raster images, emojis remain perfectly crisp at any size on screen, in PDFs, and in print. Inserting an Emoji To insert an emoji: [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":1206,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","template":"","knowledgebase_cat":[17],"class_list":["post-1189","knowledgebase","type-knowledgebase","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","knowledgebase_cat-emojis"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1189","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase"}],"about":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/knowledgebase"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=1189"}],"version-history":[{"count":10,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1189\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":1204,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1189\/revisions\/1204"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/1206"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=1189"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"knowledgebase_cat","embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase_cat?post=1189"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}